# Normalise line endings.
#
# The repository is authored on Windows but deployed on Linux. Without this,
# files are committed with CRLF and a stray carriage return ends up inside the
# value on the server: DATABASE_URL=...\r fails to connect, and systemd rejects
# an ExecStart whose path ends in \r. Everything text is stored and checked out
# with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must be LF, stated explicitly so intent survives a config change.
*.service      text eol=lf
*.conf         text eol=lf
*.sh           text eol=lf
*.yml          text eol=lf
*.yaml         text eol=lf
.env.example   text eol=lf
Dockerfile     text eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
*.xlsm binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
